[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="MachineSpecies" format=3]
; The Gleaner (HoarderBehavior): picks over the scrap around its home, pecking with its claws. It
; never fights: when the player comes near it bolts with its hoard on its back, and cowers when
; cornered.

